# Design System

- Use CSS variables from `theme/promptanatomy/static/css/tokens.css` only.
- Do not hardcode hex colors in Jinja templates.
- Light reading surfaces (`--color-surface`); dark bands use `.section--dark`.
- Body 18–20px; article column max 720px; container 1180–1240px.
- Accents sparingly (`--color-accent`).
- Allowed motion: card hover, reading progress, TOC active state.
- Forbidden: parallax, heavy animation, neon gradients, magazine clutter.
